<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>11/14 福岡四週年旅遊</name><Placemark><name>A · 博多都酒店</name><description>09:00–10:00｜起點；早餐暫以飯店為集合點。｜概略位置，請核對實際店址</description><Point><coordinates>130.4228429,33.5897507,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>B · 寶滿宮竈門神社</name><description>10:00 出發／11:00–12:00｜推薦計程車約 35–55 分；大眾運輸約 65–90 分：博多→天神→西鐵二日市→太宰府，再轉巴士／計程車。｜概略位置，請核對實際店址</description><Point><coordinates>130.5525313,33.5288381,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>C · 太宰府天滿宮</name><description>12:15–14:30｜推薦計程車約 8–12 分＋候車；步行下坡約 30–40 分、2–3 km。｜概略位置，請核對實際店址</description><Point><coordinates>130.5348239,33.5213697,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>D · 太宰府表參道</name><description>14:30–15:30｜參道步行約 5–15 分；整段散步採買約 0.5–1 km。｜概略位置，請核對實際店址</description><Point><coordinates>130.5323,33.52025,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>E · 博多都酒店</name><description>15:30–17:00｜大眾運輸約 55–75 分；計程車約 35–55 分。｜概略位置，請核對實際店址</description><Point><coordinates>130.4228429,33.5897507,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>F · せいもん払い Seimonbarai</name><description>18:00–20:00｜推薦計程車約 10–15 分；地鐵博多→中洲川端＋步行約 15–25 分。｜概略位置，請核對實際店址</description><Point><coordinates>130.4100685,33.5927466,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>G · 中洲川端河畔（散步區域）</name><description>20:00–20:40｜步行約 5–10 分、300–700 m。｜概略位置，請核對實際店址</description><Point><coordinates>130.405295,33.593647,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>H · 博多都酒店</name><description>散步後｜推薦計程車約 10–15 分；搭地鐵含步行約 20–30 分。｜概略位置，請核對實際店址</description><Point><coordinates>130.4228429,33.5897507,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>